## The Visual Science of Skincare Video Ads

Skincare and beauty consumers are hyper-attuned to sensory details. A generic testimonial saying "this cream is great" fails to convince discerning buyers.

To achieve high ROAS in the beauty category:
- **Focus on Formula Viscosity**: Capture micro-droplets dispensing from glass droppers, creamy emulsions blending effortlessly into skin pores.
- **The 3-Step Morning Routine Context**: Embed the product into everyday rituals alongside coffee and morning light.
- **Transparency on Active Ingredients**: Overlay crisp text explaining Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, or Peptides to build clinical credibility.
